<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The registrant had <span id="xdx_907_edei--EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding_iI_c20260806_zOI1T2jSOgU4"><ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2026-08-06" id="Fact000040" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">28,110,111</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common
stock outstanding at August 6, 2026.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

