<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span id="q2_014"></span><b>ITEM 2. UNREGISTERED SALES OF EQUITY SECURITIES AND USE OF PROCEEDS</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

