    <td style="width: 97%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On July 24, 2025, the Board approved a $100.0 million common stock repurchase program effective through July 24, 2027, which was increased by the Board to $150.0 million on October 10, 2025, and further increased by the Board to $200.0 million on February 2, 2026), subject to extension or earlier termination by the Board at any time. Total repurchase authority remaining under the stock repurchase program was $50.3 million as of August 6, 2026. </span></td></tr>
