<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span id="q2_015"></span><b>ITEM 3. DEFAULTS UPON SENIOR SECURITIES</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">None.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span id="q2_016"></span><b>ITEM 4. MINE SAFETY DISCLOSURES</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

